=== CONSISTENCY OF T1 AND T2
    *** THE TWO TESTS DISAGREE. T1 says spatial and T2 says temporal.
    That is the third outcome this probe was written to allow: the period is set
    by an INTERACTION of dt and dx -- a cell-Courant or cell-diffusion number --
    and neither knob owns it. Report it; do not pick one.

